BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Carole Vasta Folley's Control Top
DTSTART:20260904T193000
DTEND:20260904T210000
DTSTAMP:20260902T150909Z
UID:79d538bde0e3930c9f20c5d2a9f189@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:“IT HAS POCKETS!” This common exclamation among women open
 s Control Top\, a funny and poignant new play hosted by Lost Nation Theate
 r\, for two nights only\, September 3 and 4\, in their cozy but elegant ho
 me at Montpelier City Hall Arts Center. Written by Vermont playwright Caro
 le Vasta Folley\, the production features an ensemble of five women reflec
 ting on their lifelong relationships with clothing\, revealing what lies b
 eneath the very fabric of their lives. The cast of Control Top includes so
 me favorite actors from the Burlington theater scene: Kelly Kendall\, Lind
 a McGinnis\, Kimberly Rockwood\, Pam Toof Norton\, & playwright Carole Vas
 ta Folley.) Written with support from the Vermont Arts Council\, the Vermo
 nt Community Foundation\, and the National Endowment for the Arts\, the pl
 aywright began creating the piece by interviewing women\, hearing their pe
 rsonal stories of what they wear and why. Lost Nation Theater is delighted
  to help bring this fun\, but important show\, to more audiences after the
  play’s 2025 “premiere”. And don’t forget – not only is LNT air-
 conditioned\, but the elevator in Montpelier City Hall is once again fully
  functional! (The show will still also be live streamed.) Runtime: 90 minu
 tes. A Discussion with the Cast and the Playwright follow for those who wi
 sh to stay. Visit www.lostnationtheater.org You can also reach LNT by phon
 e: 802-229-0492. email: info@lostnationtheater.org\n\nSources: Vermont Pub
 lic
LOCATION:Lost Nation Theater\, 39 Main St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/carole-vas
 ta-folleys-control-top-20-08-2026-14-01-47
END:VEVENT
